From bc9e30130aef5f3aa849c1587d6f31e8144f0349 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jerome Soumagne <jsoumagne@hdfgroup.org>
Date: Tue, 14 May 2019 15:29:44 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Add support for chunking through --hdf5.chunkSize=x option

Add asyncData option and initial support for HDF5 asynchronous I/O

Add support for HDF5_Access

Add support for H5Fdelete

Retrieve HDF5 dataset's file dataspace upon dataset setup rather than dataset transfer

Fix hints passed to MPIIO functions
